{"3024660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skateballers", "steam_appid": 3024660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SKATEBALLERS immerses players in atmospheric post-apocalyptic extreme roller football. The game is a sports simulator with the possibility of developing relationships with companions, where you can complete a story campaign in single-player mode or in local cooperative mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make quick attacks and score goals to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/85c0cc1ecb162ddd0e16bbae86cdb6f5.poster.avif?t=1771194272\" width=298 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/85c0cc1ecb162ddd0e16bbae86cdb6f5.webm?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/85c0cc1ecb162ddd0e16bbae86cdb6f5.mp4?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight single combats with rivals, in the post-apocalypse world, all means are good for victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/c3d9418e317fefa140f5f2f0da846262.poster.avif?t=1771194272\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/c3d9418e317fefa140f5f2f0da846262.webm?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/c3d9418e317fefa140f5f2f0da846262.mp4?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid traps in the arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/3b999f91729257e971ba873ee68e7006.poster.avif?t=1771194272\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/3b999f91729257e971ba873ee68e7006.webm?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/3b999f91729257e971ba873ee68e7006.mp4?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win new equipment, apply and combine equipment depending on the required parameters and conditions of the arena.Gather new players into the team, choose a partner with whom to go to the match, depending on his skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/783142e35e5b0be30730f4a338883c34.poster.avif?t=1771194272\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/783142e35e5b0be30730f4a338883c34.webm?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/783142e35e5b0be30730f4a338883c34.mp4?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends on the split screen, on the same team or against each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/5af0143cbeeb160985f3734d297c910d.poster.avif?t=1771194272\" width=350 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/5af0143cbeeb160985f3734d297c910d.webm?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/5af0143cbeeb160985f3734d297c910d.mp4?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through the history. Find out what victory will mean for you and the entire city, as well as what the piranhas are guarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/201d20a451adf7e60e5a124961a3428a.poster.avif?t=1771194272\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/201d20a451adf7e60e5a124961a3428a.webm?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024660/extras/201d20a451adf7e60e5a124961a3428a.mp4?t=1771194272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel around the city to win the tournament, save your lives, your neighborhood and decide if you want to return the city plunged into anarchy to normal life. The ending of the game depends on your choices during the tournament: who you go to the match with, who you play for.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SKATEBALLERS immerses players in atmospheric post-apocalyptic extreme roller football. The game is a sports simulator with the possibility of developing relationships with companions, where you can complete a story campaign in single-player mode or in local cooperative mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make quick attacks and score goals to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h